*   Type: "BLOCKED" - 这是一个有向关系（Person/Organization/Event/Movement/Document -`BLOCKED`-> Person/Organization/Event/Movement/Document）。规则中定义其作用为“起阻碍、反对作用”，包括“制裁、有罪判决”等。

**关系描述分析：**
*   `properties.description.zh-cn`: "洪武三十一年（1398年）七月，李景隆奉命前往开封，将周王朱橚全家押回南京。"
*   `properties.description.en`: "In July 1398, Li Jinglong was ordered to Kaifeng to arrest the Prince of Zhou, Zhu Su, and his entire family and escort them back to Nanjing."

